      "id": "p0218-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "A sleep-themed monster named \"Knight Knight\" appears in the Core. This name is a play on the phrase \"night-night\", which is a common way of saying \"good night\" to children.",
        "raw": "A sleep-themed monster named \"Knight Knight\" appears in the Core. This\nname is a play on the phrase \"night-night\", which is a common way of saying\n\"good night\" to children.",
