      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "While the English phrase \"night-night\" isn't well known in Japan, the English phrase \"good night\" has been absorbed into the Japanese language. Because of this, the translator renamed the monster \"Good Knight\" in Japanese.",
